OL,3,GNEWSASchool of Tropical Medicine staff
OL,4,Aoppose cuts plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at the Liverpool School of
OL,7,FTropical Medicine (LSTM) have protested
OL,8,Fagainst plans to axe 32 jobs.
OL,10,FUnions have demanded "transparency"
OL,11,Fover the management's proposals, which
OL,12,Fwere shared with employees this week.
OL,14,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,15,Fsaid a voluntary severance process had
OL,16,Falready taken place and that
OL,17,F"significant redundancies" were now
OL,18,Fbeing considered.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
